  "question": {
    "text": "If the minimum distance of the point <math><mo>(</mo><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sec</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mi>α</mi><mo>,</mo><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">cosec</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mi>α</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>)</mo></math> from the circle <math><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></math> can be expressed as <math><mi>a</mi><mo>-</mo><msqrt><mi>b</mi></msqrt><mo>,</mo></math> where <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>N</mi><mo>,</mo></math>&nbsp;then the value of&nbsp;<math><mfrac><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow></mfrac></math>&nbsp;is",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "1.5",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Since,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>sec</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#8289;</mo><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>cosec</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#8289;</mo><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>=</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>tan</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#8289;</mo><mi>&#945;</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>cot</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#8289;</mo><mi>&#945;</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>tan</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>cot</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><mi>&#945;</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>tan</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>cot</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><msup><mi>&#945;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p>Hence, the point <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sec</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>,</mo><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">cos</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mi>e</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>&#945;</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfenced></math> lies outside the circle <math><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br />Now, the minimum distance<br /><math><mo>=</mo><msqrt><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sec</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">cosec</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></msqrt><mo>-</mo><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></math><br /><math><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>4</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">tan</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>-</mo><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">cot</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mi>&#945;</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></msqrt><mo>-</mo><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></math>&nbsp;(Minimum is attained, when <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>tan</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>cot</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><mi>&#945;</mi></math>)<br /><math><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mo>&#8801;</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>-</mo><msqrt><mi>b</mi></msqrt></math> (Given)<br />So, <math><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>.</mo></math></p><p>Hence,&nbsp;<math><mfrac><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>1.5</mn></math></p>",
    "image": null
  },
